{"id":"evidence:family-san-su","type":"source_text_span","source":"source/sushi.md","line_start":3,"line_end":3,"support":"source_text_claim","quote":"他与父亲苏洵、弟弟苏辙并称\"三苏\"，同列唐宋八大家。"}
{"id":"evidence:imperial-exam-1057","type":"source_text_span","source":"source/sushi.md","line_start":13,"line_end":15,"support":"source_text_claim","quote":"1057年科举考试由欧阳修担任主考官，他看到苏轼的策论文章，大为赞赏。苏轼与弟弟苏辙同科中举。"}
{"id":"evidence:new-policies-conflict","type":"source_text_span","source":"source/sushi.md","line_start":19,"line_end":19,"support":"source_text_claim","quote":"1067年宋神宗即位，王安石推行新法。苏轼与王安石政见不合，多次上书批评新法。"}
{"id":"evidence:wutai-poetry-case","type":"source_text_span","source":"source/sushi.md","line_start":25,"line_end":29,"support":"source_text_claim","quote":"御史台官员李定、舒亶等人搜集他的诗作，断章取义，指控他讪谤朝政。苏轼被押送回京，关进御史台监狱。"}
{"id":"evidence:huangzhou-creation","type":"source_text_span","source":"source/sushi.md","line_start":33,"line_end":37,"support":"source_text_claim","quote":"黄州时期是苏轼文学创作的黄金时期。他在这里创作了大量千古传诵的名篇。"}
{"id":"evidence:hangzhou-governance","type":"source_text_span","source":"source/sushi.md","line_start":41,"line_end":43,"support":"source_text_claim","quote":"这条长约2.8公里的堤坝将西湖分为里湖和外湖，有效改善了水质。后人将这条堤称为\"苏堤\"。"}
{"id":"evidence:huizhou-exile-1094","type":"source_text_span","source":"source/sushi.md","line_start":51,"line_end":51,"support":"source_text_claim","quote":"1094年苏轼被贬惠州。"}
{"id":"evidence:danzhou-exile-1097","type":"source_text_span","source":"source/sushi.md","line_start":51,"line_end":51,"support":"source_text_claim","quote":"1097年62岁的苏轼被一贬再贬，最后被贬至海南岛儋州。"}
{"id":"evidence:changzhou-return-1101","type":"source_text_span","source":"source/sushi.md","line_start":55,"line_end":55,"support":"source_text_claim","quote":"1101年苏轼遇赦北归。当他到达常州时一病不起。"}
{"id":"evidence:literary-affiliations","type":"source_text_span","source":"source/sushi.md","line_start":59,"line_end":59,"support":"source_text_claim","quote":"在诗歌方面与黄庭坚并称\"苏黄\"；在词方面与辛弃疾并称\"苏辛\"；在散文方面是\"唐宋八大家\"之一；在书法方面是\"宋四家\"之首。"}
